# Live probes drive the real app, the real engine and the real browser, so their source and their output carry the
# owner's actual browsing: real hostnames, session ids, captured page text. Machine-only — never tracked, never
# committed. Their runtime stores (a Chrome profile, captured runs) are the same data and are ignored for the same
# reason.
